- G | accept for the band's sake, with the whole band drumming behind | title: lead actor or actress; professional actor | requires: professional actor | without: approval | lacking: .3 | v: benevolence, tradition | chance: 15
- WU | ask the shaman, by the old custom, what the mask takes from its wearer | v: tradition, conformity | chance: 70
